OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a landfill green energy    
OL,4,Asource under threat?                   
OL,6,FOn top of a landfill, a worker drills a
OL,7,Fhole in a pipe, and out rushes an      
OL,8,Finvisible but very audible gas under   
OL,9,Fextremely high pressure. It's like a   
OL,10,Ffire extinguisher going off.           
OL,12,FIt is methane (mostly) and it is a     
OL,13,Flegacy problem in our landfills, but   
OL,14,Falso a source of green energy, one that
OL,15,Fthe government might see slip through  
OL,16,Fits fingers.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
