OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a landfill green energy    
OL,4,Asource under threat?                   
OL,6,F"Landfill sites such as this date back 
OL,7,Fto an era where we just simply buried  
OL,8,Fall of our waste in the ground rather  
OL,9,Fthan recycling it," Trevor Hutchings,  
OL,10,Fchief executive of the Renewable Energy
OL,11,FTrade Association, said.               
OL,13,F"And of course that's created an       
OL,14,Fenvironmental legacy because as that   
OL,15,Fwaste breaks down it gives us methane  
OL,16,Femissions, which are really quite      
OL,17,Fpotent when it comes to climate change 
OL,18,F- 80 times more potent than just carbon
OL,19,Femissions."                            
